## 📄 .gitignore (Python + FastAPI + Docker + Fintech specifics)

```gitignore
# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*.pyd
*.pdb
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
*.egg

# Virtual environments
venv/
env/
.venv/
ENV/

# IDE / Editor
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Logs
*.log

# Databases
*.sqlite3
*.db

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Pytest & Coverage
.cache/
.pytest_cache/
htmlcov/
.coverage
.coverage.*
*.cover

# Build / dist
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/

# Docker
docker-compose.override.yml
*.pid
*.seed
*.bak

# Environment & Secrets
.env
.env.*
secrets.json

seed/